#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:4
msgid "Personalized Federated Learning Algorithms"
msgstr "个性化联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:6
msgid ""
"In personalized federated learning (PFL), each client seeks a model tailored"
" to its own data distribution while still benefiting from the knowledge of "
"the other clients. A simple and general way to formulate PFL is via *weak "
"consensus*: instead of enforcing full consensus :math:`\\theta_1 = \\cdots ="
" \\theta_K`, one adds a regularizer :math:`\\mathcal{R}` that penalizes the "
"deviation between the local models. This page collects the PFL algorithms "
"(implemented in ``fl_sim`` or closely related) together with their modeling,"
" theory, and pseudocodes."
msgstr ""
"在个性化联邦学习 (Personalized Federated Learning, PFL) "
"中，每个子节点都寻求一个适合自身数据分布的模型，同时仍受益于其他子节点上的知识。对 PFL 进行建模的一种简单而通用的方式是*弱共识* (Weak "
"Consensus)：不再强制完全共识 :math:`\\theta_1 = \\cdots = "
"\\theta_K`，而是添加一个惩罚子节点模型之间偏差的正则项 :math:`\\mathcal{R}`。本页收集各 PFL 算法（在 "
"``fl_sim`` 中实现的以及密切相关的），并给出它们的建模、理论与伪代码。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:16
msgid "``L2SGD``: Loopless Local SGD"
msgstr "``L2SGD``：无环局部随机梯度下降"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:18
msgid ""
"The simplest algorithm of this family is the loopless stochastic gradient "
"descent (Loopless Local SGD, ``L2SGD``) introduced in "
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`]. It considers the following weak-"
"consensus problem"
msgstr ""
"这一族算法中最简单的是 [:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] 提出的无环随机梯度下降（Loopless Local"
" SGD，``L2SGD``）。它考虑如下弱共识问题"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:22
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize & F(\\Theta) = f(\\Theta) + \\lambda \\varphi(\\Theta) \\\\\n"
"\\text{where} & f(\\Theta) = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K f_k(\\theta_k), \\\\\n"
"& \\varphi(\\Theta) = \\frac{1}{2K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\lVert \\theta_k - \\bar{\\theta} \\right\\rVert^2\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\lVert \\theta_k - \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^K \\theta_j \\right\\rVert^2, \\\\\n"
"& \\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K),\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:33
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` is the penalty coefficient and "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta} = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^K \\theta_k` is the global "
"average model. For :math:`0 < \\lambda < \\infty`, the solution "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` is called a set of "
"*mixed models*. It is easy to see that this problem is equivalent to the "
"problem considered by ``FedProx`` (cf. the constrained problem in the "
":ref:`proximal algorithms section <fl_alg_proximal>`)."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` 为罚参数，:math:`\\bar{\\theta} = \\frac{1}{K} "
"\\sum_{k=1}^K \\theta_k` 为全局平均模型。当 :math:`0 < \\lambda < \\infty` 时，解 "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` 被称作一组*混合模型*（mixed "
"models）。容易看出，上述问题与 :ref:`临近算法一节 <fl_alg_proximal>` 中 ``FedProx`` 所考察的问题等价。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:40
msgid ""
"Instead of evaluating the full gradient :math:`\\nabla F = \\nabla f + "
"\\lambda \\nabla \\varphi` at every iteration, "
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] defines an unbiased stochastic "
"gradient of :math:`F`"
msgstr ""
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] 没有在每次迭代都计算完整的梯度 :math:`\\nabla F = "
"\\nabla f + \\lambda \\nabla \\varphi`，而是为 :math:`F` 定义了如下无偏随机梯度"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:44
msgid ""
"G(\\Theta) := \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\frac{\\nabla f(\\Theta)}{1 - p}, & \\text{with probability } 1 - p, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\lambda \\nabla \\varphi(\\Theta)}{p}, & \\text{with probability } p,\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:52
msgid ""
"with :math:`p \\in (0, 1)`. Note that computing :math:`\\nabla f(\\Theta) = "
"\\col(\\nabla f_1(\\theta_1), \\ldots, \\nabla f_K(\\theta_K))` is "
"completely block-separable: in the federated setting, this step is carried "
"out locally on the clients without any communication with the server, which "
"is a significant advantage in communication-constrained scenarios. In this "
"sense, ``L2SGD`` already incorporates the *loopless* (skipping) idea; cf. "
"the ``ProxSkip`` algorithm in the :ref:`skipping algorithms section "
"<fl_alg_skipping>`. Under the additional finite-sum assumption "
":math:`f_k(\\theta_k) = \\sum_{j=1}^m f_{k,j}(\\theta_k)`, one can further "
"combine the stochastic gradient with randomized Kaczmarz-type (importance-"
"sampled) updates; see [:footcite:ct:`Kovalev2020_loopless`] for the analysis"
" of loopless methods. The resulting method is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`p \\in (0, 1)`。注意，计算 :math:`\\nabla f(\\Theta) = \\col(\\nabla "
"f_1(\\theta_1), \\ldots, \\nabla f_K(\\theta_K))` "
"是完全块分离的：在联邦学习的场景下，这一步只需在客户端本地完成，不涉及与服务器的任何通信，这对以通信为主要瓶颈的联邦学习是巨大的优势。从这个意义上说，``L2SGD``"
" 已经融入了*无环*（跳步）的思想；参见 :ref:`跳步算法一节 <fl_alg_skipping>` 中的 "
"``ProxSkip``。在额外的有限和假设 :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) = \\sum_{j=1}^m "
"f_{k,j}(\\theta_k)` 下，还可以进一步把该随机梯度与随机 Kaczmarz 型（重要性采样）更新结合起来；关于无环方法的分析参见 "
"[:footcite:ct:`Kovalev2020_loopless`]。由此得到的算法总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:70
msgid "``pFedMe``: Personalized Federated Mean"
msgstr "``pFedMe``：个性化联邦均值算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:72
msgid ""
"The ``pFedMe`` algorithm [:footcite:ct:`t2020pfedme`] considers a weak-"
"consensus problem of the same family as :eq:`l2sgd`, with the global model "
"appearing as a single variable :math:`\\theta \\in \\R^d`,"
msgstr ""
"``pFedMe`` 算法 [:footcite:ct:`t2020pfedme`] 考虑了与 :eq:`l2sgd` "
"同一族的弱共识问题，其中全局模型作为单一变量 :math:`\\theta \\in \\R^d` 出现，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:76
msgid ""
"\\DeclareMathOperator*{\\minimize}{minimize}\n"
"\\DeclareMathOperator*{\\argmin}{arg\\,min}\n"
"\\newcommand{\\R}{\\mathbb{R}}\n"
"\\newcommand{\\prox}{\\mathbf{prox}}\n"
"\n"
"\\minimize_{\\theta, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K} \\quad \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\{ f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\left\\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta \\right\\rVert^2 \\right\\},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:86
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` is the penalty coefficient. Exploiting "
"the center--client structure of federated learning, the problem is "
"equivalently reformulated as a *bi-level optimization problem*,"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` 是罚参数。特别地，文献基于联邦学习中心节点--"
"子节点这一二元结构，进一步将上述问题等价地转换为一个*双层优化问题* (Bi-level Optimization Problem)，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:90
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize & F(\\theta) := \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K F_k(\\theta), \\\\\n"
"\\text{where} & F_k(\\theta) = \\min\\limits_{\\theta_k \\in \\R^d} \\left\\{ f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\left\\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta \\right\\rVert^2 \\right\\},\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:98
msgid ""
"whose inner objective :math:`F_k(\\theta)` is exactly the *Moreau envelope* "
"of :math:`f_k`, :math:`\\mathcal{M}_{f_k, \\lambda}(\\theta) := "
"\\inf_{\\theta_k} \\{ f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k"
" - \\theta \\rVert^2 \\}`, and the inner minimizer is the proximal operator "
":math:`\\prox_{f_k, \\lambda}(\\theta) := \\argmin_{\\theta_k} \\{ "
"f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta \\rVert^2 "
"\\}` evaluated at the global model. This proximal point is precisely the "
"personalized model of client :math:`k`. By the Moreau envelope--proximal "
"operator relation, the gradient of the outer objective is"
msgstr ""
"其内层目标函数 :math:`F_k(\\theta)` 恰为 :math:`f_k` 的 *Moreau 包络* "
":math:`\\mathcal{M}_{f_k, \\lambda}(\\theta) := \\inf_{\\theta_k} \\{ "
"f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta \\rVert^2 "
"\\}`，而相应的内层极小点即临近算子 :math:`\\prox_{f_k, \\lambda}(\\theta) := "
"\\argmin_{\\theta_k} \\{ f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\lVert "
"\\theta_k - \\theta \\rVert^2 \\}` 在全局模型 :math:`\\theta` 处的取值——这个取值正是 "
"``pFedMe`` 算法得到的子节点 :math:`k` 上的个性化模型。通过 Moreau 包络与临近算子的关系式可知，外层目标函数的梯度为"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:106
msgid ""
"\\nabla F(\\theta) = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\nabla \\mathcal{M}_{f_k, \\lambda} (\\theta)\n"
"= \\frac{\\lambda}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left( \\theta - \\prox_{f_k, \\lambda} (\\theta) \\right),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:112
msgid ""
"so that one (stochastic) gradient step on :math:`F` decomposes into the "
"average of the client-side partial updates :math:`\\theta^{(t)} - \\eta "
"\\lambda \\left( \\theta^{(t)} - \\prox_{f_k, \\lambda} (\\theta^{(t)}) "
"\\right)`. Operationally, each client holds a copy :math:`\\omega_k^{(t, "
"r)}` of the global model and, between two communications, alternates for "
":math:`R` rounds"
msgstr ""
"如此，对 :math:`F` 的一步（随机）梯度下降即分解为子节点侧部分更新 :math:`\\theta^{(t)} - \\eta \\lambda"
" \\left( \\theta^{(t)} - \\prox_{f_k, \\lambda} (\\theta^{(t)}) \\right)` "
"的平均。具体执行时，每个子节点持有全局模型的一份拷贝 :math:`\\omega_k^{(t, r)}`，并在两次通信之间交替执行 :math:`R`"
" 轮"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:117
msgid ""
"\\theta_k^{(t, r)} \\gets \\prox_{f_k, \\lambda} \\left( \\omega_k^{(t, r)}; \\ b_r \\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\omega_k^{(t, r+1)} \\gets \\omega_k^{(t, r)} - \\eta \\lambda \\left( \\omega_k^{(t, r)} - \\prox_{f_k, \\lambda} \\left( \\omega_k^{(t, r)} \\right) \\right),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:124
msgid ""
"where :math:`b_r` is the minibatch of round :math:`r`; the server then "
"aggregates"
msgstr "其中 :math:`b_r` 是第 :math:`r` 轮的小批量数据；随后中心节点进行聚合"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:126
msgid ""
"\\theta^{(t+1)} \\gets (1-\\beta)\\,\\theta^{(t)} + \\frac{\\beta}{\\# "
"\\mathcal{S}^{(t)}} \\sum\\limits_{k \\in \\mathcal{S}^{(t)}} "
"\\omega_{k}^{(t, R)}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:131
msgid ""
"Note that the two parts of :eq:`pfedme-local` are executed for :math:`R` "
"local rounds *before* any communication happens -- yet another instance of "
"the loopless (skipping) idea; cf. :ref:`L2SGD <fl_alg_pfl_l2sgd>` and the "
":ref:`skipping algorithms section <fl_alg_skipping>`. The pseudocode is "
"summarized below."
msgstr ""
"值得特别注意的是，:eq:`pfedme-local` 的两部分并不是交替进行的，而是先在子节点上执行 :math:`R` "
"轮本地迭代，之后才与中心节点通信——这是无环（跳步）思想的又一个实例；参见 :ref:`L2SGD <fl_alg_pfl_l2sgd>` 以及 "
":ref:`跳步算法一节 <fl_alg_skipping>`。伪代码总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:143
msgid "``Ditto``: Fair and Robust Personalized Models"
msgstr "``Ditto``：公平且鲁棒的个性化模型"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:145
msgid ""
"The ``Ditto`` algorithm [:footcite:ct:`li_2021_ditto`] develops the "
"proximal-subproblem idea of ``FedProx`` into a *bi-level* formulation seen "
"from the *client's* perspective (``APFL``, proposed slightly earlier, adopts"
" a similar viewpoint; see below),"
msgstr ""
"``Ditto`` 算法 [:footcite:ct:`li_2021_ditto`] 进一步发展了 ``FedProx`` "
"添加临近项求解子问题的思想，将其改造为从*子节点*视角出发的*双层*问题格式（稍早提出的 ``APFL`` 也采用了类似的视角，见下文），"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:149
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize\\limits_{\\omega_k} & h_k(\\omega_k, \\theta^*) := f_k(\\omega_k) + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\omega_k - \\theta^* \\rVert^2, \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\theta^* \\in \\argmin\\limits_{\\theta} G\\left( f_1(\\theta), \\cdots, f_K(\\theta) \\right),\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:157
msgid ""
"where :math:`G` is the aggregation rule applied by the server to the client "
"models, e.g. plain averaging as in ``FedAvg``. Reading the formulation: the "
"inner problem is a plain federated optimization problem on the global model "
":math:`\\theta` alone, while the outer problem attaches to each client a "
"proximal task for personalization -- and the personalized model "
":math:`\\omega_k` does *not* participate in the global update. The global "
"and the personalized models are thereby decoupled, and their updates can be "
"scheduled flexibly."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`G` 是中心节点上对子节点模型执行聚合的规则，例如 ``FedAvg`` 中的求均值。解读这一问题格式：内层问题即是仅关于全局模型 "
":math:`\\theta` 的一个普通联邦优化问题，而外层问题则为每个子节点附带一个用于个性化的临近任务——且个性化模型 "
":math:`\\omega_k` *不*参与全局模型的更新。全局模型与个性化模型由此解耦合，两者的迭代更新可以更灵活地进行。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:164
msgid ""
"Consequently, each client solves two problems per round: the global update "
":math:`\\theta_k^{(t)} \\gets "
"\\operatorname{\\mathbf{UpdateGlobal}}(\\theta^{(t)}, f_k)` (the inner "
"problem), and the proximal task whose solution tracks the moving center "
":math:`\\theta^{(t)}`,"
msgstr ""
"由此，每个子节点每轮求解两个问题：全局模型的更新 :math:`\\theta_k^{(t)} \\gets "
"\\operatorname{\\mathbf{UpdateGlobal}}(\\theta^{(t)}, f_k)`（内层问题），以及解点追踪移动中心"
" :math:`\\theta^{(t)}` 的临近任务，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:169
msgid ""
"\\omega_k^{(t+1)} \\gets \\omega_k^{(t)} - \\eta \\left( \\nabla "
"f_k(\\omega_k^{(t)}) + \\mu \\left( \\omega_k^{(t)} - \\theta^{(t)} \\right)"
" \\right)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:174
msgid ""
"Unlike ``FedSplit`` or ``pFedMe``, where the proximal operator is solved in "
"an inner loop to (approximate) optimality, ``Ditto`` executes only a "
"*single* (stochastic) gradient step per round for the outer problem, letting"
" the proximal center :math:`\\theta^{(t)}` evolve alongside the global "
"model. The pseudocode is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"与 ``FedSplit`` 或 ``pFedMe`` 在内循环中将临近算子求解至（近似）最优不同，``Ditto`` "
"对外层问题每轮只执行*一步*（随机）梯度下降，让临近中心 :math:`\\theta^{(t)}` 随全局模型一起演化。伪代码总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:186
msgid "``APFL``: Adaptive Personalized Federated Learning"
msgstr "``APFL``：自适应个性化联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:188
msgid ""
"Proposed slightly before ``Ditto`` [:footcite:ct:`deng2020_apfl`], ``APFL`` "
"considers the bi-level problem"
msgstr "比 ``Ditto`` 稍早提出的 ``APFL`` [:footcite:ct:`deng2020_apfl`] 考虑了如下的双层问题"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:191
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize\\limits_{\\omega_k \\in \\mathrm{dom} f_k} & h_k(\\omega_k, \\theta^*) := f_k\\left( \\alpha_k \\omega_k + (1 - \\alpha_k) \\theta^* \\right), \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\theta^* \\in \\argmin\\limits_{\\theta} \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K f_k(\\theta),\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:199
msgid ""
"with the *mixture weight* :math:`\\alpha_k \\in (0, 1)`. The main difference"
" from :eq:`ditto-bilevel` is the personalization mechanism: instead of a "
"quadratic proximal term, the local objective is evaluated at the convex "
"combination :math:`\\alpha_k \\omega_k + (1 - \\alpha_k) \\theta^*` of an "
"auxiliary local model and the global model, and :math:`\\alpha_k` plays the "
"same \"personalization degree\" role as the penalty :math:`\\mu` in a "
"proximal term. The resulting personalized model is"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\alpha_k \\in (0, 1)` 被称作*混合权重* (Mixture Weights)。与 :eq:`ditto-"
"bilevel` 最主要的区别在于个性化的机制：不再是二次临近项，而是将局部目标函数在辅助局部模型与全局模型的凸组合 :math:`\\alpha_k "
"\\omega_k + (1 - \\alpha_k) \\theta^*` 处取值；混合权重 :math:`\\alpha_k` 起到与临近项中罚参数"
" :math:`\\mu` 类似的调节子节点模型个性化程度的作用。最终得到的个性化模型为"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:206
msgid ""
"\\hat{\\omega}_k = \\alpha_k \\omega_k^* + (1 - \\alpha_k) \\theta^*,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\omega_k^* = \\argmin\\limits_{\\omega_k \\in \\mathrm{dom} f_k} f_k\\left( \\alpha_k \\omega_k + (1 - \\alpha_k) \\theta^* \\right)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:213
msgid ""
"A caveat worth noting: when :math:`\\mathrm{dom} f_k` is a *proper* subset "
"of :math:`\\R^d`, the convex combination in :eq:`apfl-model` may fail to "
"attain a minimizer of :math:`f_k` -- the range of :math:`\\alpha_k "
"\\omega_k^* + (1 - \\alpha_k) \\theta^*` can be a strict subset of the "
"search domain that excludes the minimizer. Enlarging the search domain of "
":math:`\\omega_k` restores attainability, but then :math:`\\hat{\\omega}_k` "
"could equally be obtained by minimizing :math:`f_k` alone, i.e. by pure "
"local training -- which contradicts the very goal of personalized federated "
"learning. The pseudocode is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"值得特别注意的是：当 :math:`\\mathrm{dom} f_k` 是 :math:`\\R^d` 的*真*子集时，:eq:`apfl-"
"model` 中的凸组合可能无法取到 :math:`f_k` 的极小点——凸组合 :math:`\\alpha_k \\omega_k^* + (1 -"
" \\alpha_k) \\theta^*` 能取到的区域可以只是搜索区域的一个真子集，且不包含极小点。扩大 :math:`\\omega_k` "
"的搜索区域固然可以恢复可达性，但此时 :math:`\\hat{\\omega}_k` 完全可以通过直接极小化 "
":math:`f_k`（即仅使用节点自身的数据进行训练）获取——这与个性化联邦学习的目的是相违背的。伪代码总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:228
msgid "``FedDyn``: Dynamic Regularized Federated Learning"
msgstr "``FedDyn``：动态正则化联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:230
msgid ""
"The algorithms above (and ``FedProx`` alike) regularize the local objective "
"with a *static* proximal term: in round :math:`(t+1)`, client :math:`k` "
"minimizes :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k - "
"\\theta^{(t)} \\rVert^2`. The ``FedDyn`` algorithm "
"[:footcite:ct:`acar2021feddyn`] refines this into a *dynamically "
"regularized* objective,"
msgstr ""
"前文介绍的算法（以及 ``FedProx`` 等）都是以*静态*的临近项正则化局部目标函数：在第 :math:`(t+1)` 轮，子节点 "
":math:`k` 极小化 :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k - "
"\\theta^{(t)} \\rVert^2`。``FedDyn`` 算法 [:footcite:ct:`acar2021feddyn`] "
"对此进行改进，提出了*动态正则化*的目标函数，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:236
msgid ""
"F_k(\\theta_k) := f_k(\\theta_k) - \\left\\langle \\nabla f_k\\left( "
"\\theta_k^{(t)} \\right), \\theta_k \\right\\rangle + \\frac{\\mu}{2} "
"\\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta^{(t)} \\rVert^2,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:241
msgid "which is equivalent to"
msgstr "其可以等价地写为"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:243
msgid ""
"F_k(\\theta_k) = \\left( f_k(\\theta_k) + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta^{(t)} \\rVert^2 \\right)\n"
"- \\left\\langle \\nabla f_k\\left( \\theta_k^{(t)} \\right), \\theta_k - \\theta_k^{(t)} \\right\\rangle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:249
msgid ""
"In words: each (stochastic) step on :math:`F_k` follows the descent "
"direction of the prox-augmented objective, *corrected* by the linearization "
"of :math:`f_k` at the previous local iterate :math:`\\theta_k^{(t)}` (with "
":math:`\\mathfrak{g}_k^{(t)} := \\nabla f_k(\\theta_k^{(t)})`). Another "
"remarkable property is the first-order optimality condition of :eq:`feddyn-"
"obj`,"
msgstr ""
"换言之，对 :math:`F_k` 的每一步（随机）迭代都沿着带临近项目标函数的下降方向进行，并用 :math:`f_k` 在上一步局部迭代点 "
":math:`\\theta_k^{(t)}` 处的线性化（即 :math:`\\mathfrak{g}_k^{(t)} := \\nabla "
"f_k(\\theta_k^{(t)})`）对其加以*修正*。动态正则化问题 :eq:`feddyn-obj` 另一个值得注意的性质是其一阶最优性条件"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:254
msgid ""
"\\nabla f_k\\left( \\theta_k^{(t+1)} \\right) - \\nabla f_k\\left( "
"\\theta_k^{(t)} \\right) + \\mu \\left( \\theta_k^{(t+1)} - \\theta^{(t)} "
"\\right) = 0,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:259
msgid "which yields the recursion"
msgstr "由此可得如下的递推格式"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:261
msgid ""
"\\mathfrak{g}_k^{(t+1)} \\gets \\mathfrak{g}_k^{(t)} - \\mu \\left( "
"\\theta_k^{(t+1)} - \\theta^{(t)} \\right),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:266
msgid ""
"i.e. the local gradient estimate is maintained *without* additional function"
" or gradient evaluations -- a substantial computational and implementational"
" convenience. The pseudocode is summarized below."
msgstr "即局部梯度估计*无需*额外的函数或梯度计算即可维护——这对计算与算法实现是巨大的便利。伪代码总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:277
msgid "``pFedMac``: Personalized FL via Maximizing Correlation"
msgstr "``pFedMac``：极大化相关性的个性化联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:279
msgid ""
"Related to the \"direction correction\" of ``FedDyn``, the ``pFedMac`` "
"algorithm [:footcite:ct:`li2021pfedmac`] considers the bi-level problem"
msgstr ""
"与 ``FedDyn`` 的“方向修正”思路相关，``pFedMac`` 算法 [:footcite:ct:`li2021pfedmac`] "
"考虑了如下的双层问题"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:282
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize & F(\\theta) = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K F_k(\\theta), \\\\\n"
"\\text{where} & F_k(\\theta) := \\min\\limits_{\\theta_k} \\left\\{ f_k(\\theta_k) - \\mu \\langle \\theta_k, \\theta \\rangle + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta \\rVert^2_2 \\right\\},\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:290
msgid ""
"in which the inner problem corrects the personalized model :math:`\\theta_k`"
" using the global model :math:`\\theta` through their inner product. In "
"probability and statistics, :math:`\\langle \\theta_k, \\theta \\rangle` "
"quantifies the *correlation* between the personalized and the global models;"
" hence the technique is known as *maximizing correlation*. Two elementary "
"rewritings connect it to the formulations above: moving the global term out "
"of the inner minimization gives :math:`F_k(\\theta) = F_k'(\\theta) + "
"\\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta \\rVert^2_2` with :math:`F_k'(\\theta) := "
"\\min_{\\theta_k} \\{ f_k(\\theta_k) - \\mu \\langle \\theta_k, \\theta "
"\\rangle \\}`, and completing the square shows"
msgstr ""
"其中内层问题利用全局模型 :math:`\\theta` 通过内积对个性化模型 :math:`\\theta_k` "
"进行修正。在概率与统计中，:math:`\\langle \\theta_k, \\theta \\rangle` "
"量化了个性化模型与全局模型之间的*相关性*；因此该技术被称作*极大化相关性* (Maximizing "
"Correlation)。两个初等的变形将其与上文的问题格式联系起来：把全局项从内层极小化中移出，得 :math:`F_k(\\theta) = "
"F_k'(\\theta) + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta \\rVert^2_2`，其中 "
":math:`F_k'(\\theta) := \\min_{\\theta_k} \\{ f_k(\\theta_k) - \\mu \\langle"
" \\theta_k, \\theta \\rangle \\}`；而配方后可得"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:299
msgid ""
"F_k(\\theta) = \\min\\limits_{\\theta_k} \\left\\{ f_k(\\theta_k) + "
"\\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta \\rVert^2_2 - \\frac{\\mu}{2} "
"\\lVert \\theta_k \\rVert^2_2 \\right\\},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:304
msgid ""
"i.e. the prox-augmented objective corrected by a quadratic term in "
":math:`\\theta_k` itself -- exactly the flavor of :eq:`feddyn-adjusted`, so "
"the same one-step direction-correction updates apply. ``pFedMac`` further "
"studies *sparse* personalized models via an additional :math:`\\ell_1` term,"
msgstr ""
"即带临近项的目标函数再减去一个关于 :math:`\\theta_k` 自身的二次项——这正是 :eq:`feddyn-adjusted` "
"的味道，因此同样的单步方向修正更新在此适用。``pFedMac`` 进一步借助附加的 :math:`\\ell_1` 项研究了*稀疏*个性化模型，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:309
msgid ""
"F_k(\\theta) := \\min\\limits_{\\theta_k} \\left\\{ f_k(\\theta_k) - \\mu "
"\\langle \\theta_k, \\theta \\rangle + \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta "
"\\rVert^2_2 + \\gamma \\lVert \\theta_k \\rVert_1 \\right\\},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:314
msgid ""
"and extends the center--client hierarchy to a *three-level* structure with "
"sub-centers (edges or hubs), each aggregating a cluster :math:`\\{ "
"\\theta_{k,1}, \\ldots, \\theta_{k, J_k} \\}` of clients before "
"communicating with the center -- a structure expected to become increasingly"
" common as federated networks scale, and closely related to clustered FL. "
"The pseudocode is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"此外，它还将中心节点--子节点的二元结构扩展为带次中心（边缘节点或枢纽）的*三层*结构：每个次中心先聚合一个集群 :math:`\\{ "
"\\theta_{k,1}, \\ldots, \\theta_{k, J_k} \\}` "
"内的子节点模型，再与中心节点通信——随着联邦网络规模的扩大，这类结构预计会越来越常见，并与聚类联邦学习密切相关。伪代码总结如下。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:327
msgid "``FPFC``: Fusion Penalized Federated Clustering"
msgstr "``FPFC``：融合惩罚联邦聚类"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:329
msgid ""
"Beyond regularizing the deviation between each pair of *local* models (as in"
" ``L2SGD``) or between the local model and the global one, one can also "
"encourage *clusters* of clients to share identical models, without knowing "
"the clusters a priori. The fusion penalized federated clustering (``FPFC``) "
"algorithm (see `arXiv:2211.04218 <https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.04218>`_) "
"achieves this by imposing a nonconvex *pairwise* fusion penalty on the model"
" differences. Introducing the auxiliary variables :math:`\\theta_{ij} "
"\\equiv \\omega_i - \\omega_j` for all pairs :math:`i, j \\in [m]`, it "
"considers"
msgstr ""
"除了在每对*局部*模型之间的偏差（如 "
"``L2SGD``）或局部模型与全局模型之间的偏差上做正则之外，还可以在*不预先知道簇结构*的情况下，鼓励客户端聚成若干簇、簇内共享同一模型。融合惩罚联邦聚类（``FPFC``）算法（见"
" `arXiv:2211.04218 "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.04218>`_）通过在模型之差上施加非凸的*成对*融合惩罚来实现这一点。引入辅助变量 "
":math:`\\theta_{ij} \\equiv \\omega_i - \\omega_j`（:math:`i, j \\in "
"[m]`），它考虑"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:336
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize\\limits_{\\omega, \\theta} & \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m f_i(\\omega_i) + \\frac{1}{2m} \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^m \\tilde{g}(\\lVert \\theta_{ij} \\rVert) \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\omega_i - \\omega_j = \\theta_{ij}, \\qquad i, j \\in [m],\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:344
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\tilde{g}(\\cdot)` is a smoothed SCAD-type penalty "
"(parameterized by :math:`\\xi, \\lambda, a`) whose proximal operator shrinks"
" small pairwise differences towards zero (clients in the same cluster) while"
" keeping large ones (clients in different clusters) almost untouched. The "
"problem is solved via an ADMM-style (Douglas--Rachford) splitting with the "
"augmented Lagrangian penalty :math:`\\rho` and dual variables "
":math:`v_{ij}`: each round, a random subset of devices performs :math:`T_i` "
"local gradient epochs on :math:`f_i(\\omega) + \\frac{\\rho}{2} \\lVert "
"\\omega - \\zeta_i \\rVert^2`, and the server applies the piecewise proximal"
" update to :math:`\\theta_{ij}` and ascends the duals for the pairs of "
"active devices. After training, devices :math:`i` and :math:`j` are assigned"
" to the same cluster whenever :math:`\\lVert \\theta_{ij} \\rVert` is "
"(nearly) zero. The pseudocode is summarized below; note that neither the "
"number of clusters nor the cluster membership needs to be specified in "
"advance."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\tilde{g}(\\cdot)` 是平滑的 SCAD 型罚函数（由 :math:`\\xi, \\lambda, a` "
"参数化），其近端算子把较小的成对差收缩到零（同簇的客户端），而几乎不动较大的差（不同簇的客户端）。该问题用 ADMM 式（Douglas--"
"Rachford）分裂求解：增广拉格朗日罚参数为 :math:`\\rho`，对偶变量为 :math:`v_{ij}`；每一轮，随机选中的一部分设备在 "
":math:`f_i(\\omega) + \\frac{\\rho}{2} \\lVert \\omega - \\zeta_i \\rVert^2`"
" 上做 :math:`T_i` 个 epoch 的本地梯度下降，服务器对活跃设备的成对变量 :math:`\\theta_{ij}` "
"施加分段近端更新并做对偶上升。训练结束后，:math:`\\lVert \\theta_{ij} \\rVert` （近乎）为零的设备 "
":math:`i` 与 :math:`j` 被分到同一个簇。伪代码总结如下；注意，无论簇的个数还是簇的成员关系都不需要事先指定。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:363
msgid ""
"``FedCR``: Personalized Federated Learning Based on Across-Client Common "
"Representation"
msgstr "``FedCR``：基于跨客户端共性表示的个性化联邦学习"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:365
msgid ""
"The methods above personalize the *whole* local model. ``FedCR`` (see `ICML "
"2023 <https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/zhang23w.html>`_) instead decouples"
" each local model :math:`w_i = [w_i^f, w_i^p]` into a *feature extractor* "
"(body) :math:`w_i^f`, shared across clients and aggregated at the server, "
"and a *predictor* (head) :math:`w_i^p`, kept personal. The extractors are "
"aligned through a *common representation*: for each class :math:`c`, the "
"local class-conditional mutual information is constrained to be close to the"
" global one, which (via the Markov chain :math:`y \\to x \\to z`) amounts to"
" a class-wise feature alignment"
msgstr ""
"上述方法个性化的是整个局部模型。``FedCR``（见 `ICML 2023 "
"<https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/zhang23w.html>`_）则将每个局部模型 :math:`w_i = "
"[w_i^f, w_i^p]` "
"解耦为跨客户端共享、在服务器端聚合的特征提取器（主体）:math:`w_i^f`，以及保持个性化的预测器（头部）:math:`w_i^p`。特征提取器经由共性表示进行对齐：对每个类别"
" :math:`c`，局部的类条件互信息被约束为接近全局的类条件互信息；借由马尔可夫链 :math:`y \\to x \\to "
"z`，这等价于类别级的特征对齐"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:373
msgid ""
"I(z; x \\mid y_i) - I_i(z; x_i \\mid y_i) = \\mathbb{E}_{p(x_i, y_i)} "
"\\mathbb{E}_{p(x \\mid x_i, y_i)} \\left[ \\mathrm{KL}\\left[ p(z \\mid x) "
"\\,\\middle\\|\\, p(z \\mid x_i) \\right] \\right],"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:378
msgid ""
"weighted by a Lagrange multiplier :math:`\\beta \\geqslant 0` (the CMI "
"regularizer). The representation mapping is modeled as a diagonal Gaussian "
":math:`p(z \\mid x_i) = \\mathcal{N}\\left(z \\,\\middle|\\, \\mu(x_i), "
"\\Sigma(x_i)\\right)`, under which the intractable global posterior is "
"estimated by a *product of experts* (PoE) over the class-wise local "
"posteriors of the active clients :math:`\\mathcal{P}_t`, with prior "
":math:`p(z) = \\mathcal{N}(0, 1)`:"
msgstr ""
"对齐项由拉格朗日乘子 :math:`\\beta \\geqslant 0` 加权（即 CMI 正则项）。表示映射建模为对角高斯分布 "
":math:`p(z \\mid x_i) = \\mathcal{N}\\left(z \\,\\middle|\\, \\mu(x_i), "
"\\Sigma(x_i)\\right)`；在此之下，难以直接求解的全局后验由活跃客户端集合 :math:`\\mathcal{P}_t` "
"的类别级局部后验的专家乘积（PoE）来估计，先验取 :math:`p(z) = \\mathcal{N}(0, 1)`："

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:384
msgid ""
"p(z^c \\mid x) \\propto p(z) \\prod_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}_t} p^c(z \\mid x_i), \\qquad\n"
"p^c(z \\mid x_i) = \\prod_{n = 1}^{N_i^{c}} p\\left(z \\,\\middle|\\, x_i^{(n)}\\right)^{1 / N_i^{c}},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:390
msgid ""
"where :math:`p^c(z \\mid x_i)` is the (geometric-mean) local PoE over the "
":math:`N_i^{c}` samples of class :math:`c` at client :math:`i`, computed on "
"the fly from the latest forward passes of local training. As a product of "
"Gaussians is itself Gaussian, both PoEs reduce to class-wise means and "
"covariances: each client uploads :math:`(\\mu_i^c, \\Sigma_i^c)` for its "
"classes only, and the server combines them analytically via the precisions,"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`p^c(z \\mid x_i)` 为客户端 :math:`i` 上类别 :math:`c` 的 :math:`N_i^{c}` "
"个样本的（几何平均）局部专家乘积，直接取自本地训练中最新一轮前向传播的结果。高斯分布的乘积仍为高斯分布，故两个 PoE "
"都可化为类别级的均值与协方差：每个客户端只需上传其拥有的类别的 :math:`(\\mu_i^c, "
"\\Sigma_i^c)`，服务器经由精度（协方差之逆）解析地合并，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:396
msgid ""
"\\Sigma^c = \\left( I + \\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}_t} \\left( \\Sigma_i^c \\right)^{-1} \\right)^{-1}, \\qquad\n"
"\\mu^c = \\Sigma^c \\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}_t} \\mu_i^c \\left( \\Sigma_i^c \\right)^{-1},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:402
msgid ""
"besides averaging the extractors, :math:`w^f = \\frac{1}{\\lvert "
"\\mathcal{P}_t \\rvert} \\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{P}_t} w_i^f`. Classes missed"
" by all active clients keep the statistics of the previous round. The local "
"objective of client :math:`i` is its empirical loss plus the alignment term "
"above,"
msgstr ""
"同时对特征提取器做平均：:math:`w^f = \\frac{1}{\\lvert \\mathcal{P}_t \\rvert} \\sum_{i "
"\\in \\mathcal{P}_t} w_i^f`。所有活跃客户端都不具备的类别沿用上一轮的统计量。客户端 :math:`i` "
"的局部目标即其经验损失加上上述对齐项，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:406
msgid ""
"L_i = f_i(w_i) + \\beta \\, \\mathbb{E}_{p(x_i, y_i)} \\left[ "
"\\mathrm{KL}\\left[ p(z^{c = y_i} \\mid x) \\,\\middle\\|\\, p(z \\mid x_i) "
"\\right] \\right],"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:411
msgid ""
"optimized with the re-parameterization trick for the stochastic features. "
"Since the PoE posterior can be sharper than any single expert, the common "
"representation carries not only the common but also the complementary "
"information across clients; the alignment term doubles as noise injection "
"into the local features, which improves generalization and uncertainty "
"calibration. Note that for :math:`\\beta = 0` and :math:`\\Sigma(x_i) = 0` "
"(deterministic features), the method degenerates to ``FedPer``. The "
"pseudocode is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"对随机特征采用重参数化技巧进行优化。由于专家乘积的后验可以比任何单一专家更尖锐，共性表示不仅承载客户端之间的共性信息，也承载互补信息；对齐项同时起到向局部特征注入噪声的作用，可改善泛化与不确定性校准。注意当"
" :math:`\\beta = 0` 且 :math:`\\Sigma(x_i) = 0`（确定性特征）时，该方法退化为 "
"``FedPer``。伪代码总结如下。"

